  "description": "All bikes are hand-assembled at the Fly warehouse and fully customizable following these steps:\n\n1. Select the bike you want using the size, color, drive side & brake options.\n2. Proceed with the order confirmation.\n3. For any specific part change, just write in the comments section at checkout the part you’d like to replace.\n4. Confirm your order\n\n- Our team will review your request and contact you the same day to confirm the specs and info.\n- If the chosen part has a higher price, you’ll receive a payment link by email to cover the difference.\n- If the chosen part is not available, we´ll send you the delivery info.\n- Please note that no refunds are issued for parts of lower value.\n\n• The option without brakes does not include any brake hardware.\n• Easy Assembly with our 100% plastic-free recyclable packaging.\n• LHD (Left-Hand Drive) and RHD (Right-Hand Drive):\nWhere the drivetrain is located to protect the chain/sprocket when you grind.\n\nThe Supernova 18\" BMX, is one of the best Fly complete bikes for younger shredders from 7 to 12 years. It comes with 100% Chromoly bars, frame and new cone-shaped forks. In addition to this, the Supernova is fully equipped with all the Fly aftermarket parts that better suit this top 18\" BMX bike, like fully sealed hubs, Fuego 18\" tires 3p Trebol cranks, removable brake mounts, and the new 18\" adapted parts like the Fly Mini brake lever, Fly Ruben II Mini grips and the Mini stem (40 mm). All this together makes for a bike thought for the youngest riders at any level.",
